# Sitecore (App Router)

- **Data:** Server Components + `SitecoreClient` in `src/lib/sitecore-client.ts`; preview via `draftMode()` + `getPreview` / `getDesignLibraryData`
- **Routing:** single catch-all `src/app/[site]/[locale]/[[...path]]/page.tsx`; `await params`; `setRequestLocale(\`${site}_${locale}\`)`
- **Fields:** use `<Text>`, `<RichText>`, `<Image>`, `<Link>`; validate before render
- **Maps:** `.sitecore/component-map.ts` + `.sitecore/component-map.client.ts` auto-generated from `src/components/`
- **Config:** env-only in `sitecore.config.ts`; document vars in `.env.example`

